      "help.core.movement.movement_cost": {
        "parameters": {
          "press_player_data": {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "player_data"
          }
        },
        "nodes": [
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": "Each step will take 100 movement points (or more, depending on the terrain); you will then replenish a variable amount of movement points, depending on many factors (press "
          },
          {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "parameter": "press_player_data",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "player_data",
            "description": "long",
            "color": "light_blue",
            "empty_binding_text": ""
          },
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": " to see the exact amount)."
          }
        ]
      },
      "help.core.movement.melee": {
        "parameters": {},
        "nodes": [
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": "To attempt to hit a monster with your weapon, simply move into it."
          }
        ]
      },
      "help.core.movement.doors": {
        "parameters": {
          "press_open": {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "open"
          },
          "press_close": {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "close"
          },
          "press_smash": {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "smash"
          }
        },
        "nodes": [
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": "You may find doors, ('+'); these may be opened with "
          },
          {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "parameter": "press_open",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "open",
            "description": "long",
            "color": "light_blue",
            "empty_binding_text": ""
          },
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": " or closed with "
          },
          {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "parameter": "press_close",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "close",
            "description": "long",
            "color": "light_blue",
            "empty_binding_text": ""
          },
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": ".  Some doors are locked.  Locked doors, windows, and some other obstacles can be destroyed by smashing them ("
          },
          {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "parameter": "press_smash",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "smash",
            "description": "long",
            "color": "light_blue",
            "empty_binding_text": ""
          },
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": ", then choose a direction).  Smashing down obstacles is much easier with a good weapon or a strong character."
          }
        ]
      },
      "help.core.movement.safe_mode": {
        "parameters": {
          "press_safemode": {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "safemode"
          }
        },
        "nodes": [
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": "There may be times when you want to move more quickly by holding down a movement key.  However, fast movement in this fashion may lead to the player getting into a dangerous situation or even killed before they have a chance to react.  Pressing "
          },
          {
            "kind": "key_binding",
            "parameter": "press_safemode",
            "category": "DEFAULTMODE",
            "action": "safemode",
            "description": "long",
            "color": "light_blue",
            "empty_binding_text": ""
          },
          {
            "kind": "literal",
            "value": " will toggle \"safe mode.\"  While this is on, any movement will be ignored if new monsters enter the player's view."
          }
        ]
      },
